<div id="content" class="flex-vert flex-align-center">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style/about.css"/>

    <div class="fill-width flex-vert flex-align-center">
        <span style="font-family: '3dthirteen'; font-size: 5cqi;">About</span>
        <hr class="fill-width" />
    </div>

    <p id="about-text">
        I was inspired to start this side-project by the YouTuber <a target="_blank" style="color: lightgreen" href="https://www.youtube.com/@@onionboots">onionboots</a>.<br />
        His "web revival" video, dated 2/19/2026, was pretty illuminating. It reminded me of an internet that I vaguely knew when I was younger and not so social-media addicted.<br />
        <br />
        Being a bit of a computer nerd, I figured it prudent to fill my free-time with the development of my own website in the "indie web" style onionboots so convincingly sold.<br />
        <br />
        I'm not all that artsy and creative, so this may look a bit drab for a while. However, if my hazy visions come true, this website will one day be pretty cool.<br />
        <br />
        If you're reading this, please take care, and be sure to pay me a visit every so often! :)<br />
        - Konym
    </p>

    <div class="flex-horiz" style="gap: 25px;">
        <div class="page-specs flex-vert flex-align-center">
            <span class="fill-width specs-header">Page Specifications</span>

            <div class="flex-horiz specs-content">
                <span style="text-align: left;">
                    Project Begin<br />
                    Latest Update<br />
                    Latest Task
                </span>

                <span style="text-align: left;">
                    Feburary 2026<br />
                    11-18-2026 ~8PM PST<br />
                    Zones and Mp3Player updates
                </span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="page-specs flex-vert flex-align-center">
            <span class="fill-width specs-header">Web Server Specifications</span>

            <div class="flex-horiz specs-content">
                <span style="text-align: left;">
                    Uptime<br />
                    Battery Percentage<br />
                    Plugged In?
                </span>

                <span
                    style="text-align: left;"
                    hx-indicator="#none"

                    hx-get="/frag/get-server-power-info"
                    hx-trigger="load, every 5s [document.hidden === false]"
                    hx-target="this"
                    hx-swap="innerHTML"
                />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
